{%- comment -%}
  Action Target registry for variants. Dawn's pickers are keyed by option value, not by
  variant id, so the agent's `variant_id` needs somewhere to land. Each entry carries the
  option values the picker actually understands; the widget sets them and lets Dawn re-render.

  Hidden, not interactive: this is a lookup table the agent addresses by id.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div hidden data-wayfinder-variant-targets>
  {%- for variant in product.variants -%}
    <span
      data-agent-action='{{ variant.id }}'
      data-wayfinder-options='{{ variant.options | join: '~~' | escape }}'
    ></span>
  {%- endfor -%}
</div>
